{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_5988C6F7","title":"Mary Nyx Staging Request","entry":"Dlg_5988C6F7::entry","exit":"Dlg_5988C6F7::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_816699FD","articyId":"72057791606425009","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mary-Nyx Curzona","text":"Ah, just the person I was hoping to see. I have an opportunity for you.","speakerId":"Ntt_1672A850","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Ah, just the person I was hoping to see. I have an opportunity for you.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":175.0,"y":150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"34941","byteOffset":25577672,"byteLength":416}},{"id":"DFr_F1386ECA","articyId":"72057791606425022","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mary-Nyx Curzona","text":"Mmf. You again. Much as it pains me to say it, I might have a job for you.","speakerId":"Ntt_1672A850","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Mmf. You again. Much as it pains me to say it, I might have a job for you.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":175.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"33324","byteOffset":20491176,"byteLength":420}},{"id":"DFr_5F755CCD","articyId":"72057791606425043","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mary-Nyx Curzona","text":"I have a property in my portfolio that I've grown tired of. A dull little apartment. It needs furnishing.","speakerId":"Ntt_1672A850","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I have a property in my portfolio that I've grown tired of. A dull little apartment. It needs furnishing.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":775.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"28792","byteOffset":18775712,"byteLength":416}},{"id":"DFr_D791F4F0","articyId":"72057791606425057","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mary-Nyx Curzona","text":"Because the market is simply too ignorant to appreciate my tastes. It needs a... common touch. Something insipid enough to appeal to the masses.","speakerId":"Ntt_1672A850","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Because the market is simply too ignorant to appreciate my tastes. It needs a... common touch. Something insipid enough to appeal to the masses.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1325.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"33414","byteOffset":20526096,"byteLength":488}},{"id":"DFr_C50506FF","articyId":"72057791606425089","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mary-Nyx Curzona","text":"Excellent. The furnishings must be of the highest quality, of course. Enough to impress the silly reptile brains of potential buyers.","speakerId":"Ntt_1672A850","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Excellent. The furnishings must be of the highest quality, of course. Enough to impress the silly reptile brains of potential buyers.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":2225.0,"y":250.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"19180","byteOffset":15140816,"byteLength":444}},{"id":"DFr_15FC9760","articyId":"72057791606425096","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mary-Nyx Curzona","text":"You are quite possibly the most tiresome person I have ever met. And the stupidest. Enjoy poverty, you pathetic reptile.","speakerId":"Ntt_1672A850","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You are quite possibly the most tiresome person I have ever met. And the stupidest. Enjoy poverty, you pathetic reptile.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":2225.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"18967","byteOffset":15062624,"byteLength":428}},{"id":"DFr_AC0AA65D","articyId":"72057791606425110","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mary-Nyx Curzona","text":"The outlay will be yours, of course. But do as I ask and you stand to make a profit. That I can guarantee.","speakerId":"Ntt_1672A850","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"The outlay will be yours, of course. But do as I ask and you stand to make a profit. That I can guarantee.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":2800.0,"y":250.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"40646","byteOffset":29705416,"byteLength":416}},{"id":"DFr_EF499492","articyId":"72057791606425029","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I'm all ears.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'm all ears.","TextSheVersion":"I'm all ears.","TextTheyVersion":"I'm all ears."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":475.0,"y":150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"40913","byteOffset":29805256,"byteLength":296}},{"id":"DFr_24F924EC","articyId":"72057791606425036","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Why me?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Why me?","TextSheVersion":"Why me?","TextTheyVersion":"Why me?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":475.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"17363","byteOffset":14457384,"byteLength":288}},{"id":"DFr_DA8E7210","articyId":"720577916